        "slc_0095d351465ee7fb1cefdeddb75a62550bfb2e062f3a21718ff2058a74720ddd"
      ],
      "text": "The project is a headless coding agent built on the Embabel agent platform, intended both for developing Embabel and as a standalone open source project."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6cf838a593ba8a021993d093763cdc36c07a49f851d17bcd9d50d1c173724973",
