          "url": "https://github.com/embabel/coding-agent/blob/b0997231880dbcd5262c4883e908d5bb445ce47b/README.md#L39-L43"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_65871249009d45701be47b06dbc2535e3c20da3c8c36f07eff3f394e46ba0b1c"
      ],
      "text": "Key capabilities listed include explaining code, creating new Embabel projects, making multi-file code changes, writing documentation, and combining project code access with internet research such as researching new APIs."
    },
